v = 1.5 \times 100 = 150 \text{ cm}
The distance \(v\) is measured from the pole of the spherical surface. The question asks for the distance \(x\) from the centre of curvature.
From the diagram, the distance \(x\) from the centre of curvature is given by:
x = v - R
Substituting the values of \(v\) and \(R\):
